  "notes": [
    "This is a structural research contract and expected-outcome corpus, not a credential parser, signature verifier, DHA API client, or proof that any cryptographic vector has passed.",
    "All vectors are synthetic policy scenarios, not South African government credentials.",
    "OVS and smartphone Digital ID are different evidence methods. Never promote one method's status or assurance into the other.",
    "Identity evidence does not by itself establish a service entitlement, residency, citizenship, Mycelix membership, reputation, vote, or execution authority.",
    "The executable synthetic policy oracle exercises disposition ordering from synthetic inputs only; its verified outcome does not prove cryptographic validity or government identity.",
    "The DHA 2026/27 Annual Performance Plan sets hosting/PKI infrastructure completion as a 2026/27 target and separately plans wallet-issued verifiable credentials for 2027/28; these are targets, not evidence of completed production integration.",
    "A Parliament committee oversight report published 8 May 2026, assessing 2025/26 Q3, recorded that the Digital Identity/PKI programme target was not achieved in that reporting period: procurement was paused pending clarification of the revised hosting/governance model, including a proposed SARS-based hosting approach and Certificate Authority responsibilities. This is historical programme evidence, not a claim about the later October 2026 prototype or the current completion state."
  ]
}
